  "code": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Fieldnotes — editorial starter</title><style>\n:root{--paper:#f4efe4;--ink:#282b25;--muted:#575a50;--accent:#85391f;--line:#9a9c8b;--space:clamp(1rem,4vw,3rem)}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:auto}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:.25em}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:5px}.skip{position:absolute;left:1rem;top:-8rem;background:var(--paper);padding:1rem;z-index:2}.skip:focus{top:1rem}.shell{max-width:80rem;margin:auto;padding:var(--space)}header{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;border-block:1px solid var(--ink);padding:.8rem 0}.brand{font:700 1.5rem Georgia,serif}nav{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.eyebrow{font:.8rem/1.5 system-ui;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}.lead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:var(--space);padding:3rem 0}h1{font:400 clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5.5rem)/1.02 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:13ch;margin:.4rem 0 1.5rem}h2{font:400 clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.6rem)/1.15 Georgia,serif}.lede{max-width:40ch;font-size:1.15rem}.button{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:.7rem 1.1rem;margin-top:1rem;text-decoration:none}.button:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}figure{margin:0;align-self:center}.art{height:clamp(16rem,35vw,29rem);background:#c2c4ae;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--ink)}.art:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:15% 25% -10%;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;background:#737b62;transform:rotate(-18deg)}.art:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:38%;aspect-ratio:1;top:9%;right:8%;border-radius:50%;background:#e9caa7}figcaption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);padding-top:.5rem}.stories{border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5rem 1.1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.5rem 0}.story h3{font:400 1.6rem/1.25 Georgia,serif;margin:0}.story p{margin:0;max-width:45ch}.number{color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}#main,#stories,#about{scroll-margin-top:1rem}@media(max-width:48rem){.lead{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story{grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr}.story p{grid-column:2}h1{max-width:15ch}nav{gap:1rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}\n</style></head><body><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"shell\"><header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#main\">Fieldnotes</a><nav aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"#stories\">Reading list</a><a href=\"#about\">About this edition</a></nav></header><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\"><section class=\"lead\" aria-labelledby=\"title\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">An independent editorial layout · Issue 01</p><h1 id=\"title\">Make room for slower ideas.</h1><p class=\"lede\">A sample journal about useful objects, thoughtful spaces, and the ordinary decisions that shape a day.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"#stories\">Explore the reading list →</a></div><figure><div class=\"art\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Original abstract illustration: an olive arch and a pale terracotta sun\"></div><figcaption>Study in balance · original CSS illustration, not a photograph</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"stories\" id=\"stories\" aria-labelledby=\"reading\"><h2 id=\"reading\">Three starting points</h2><article class=\"story\"><span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01 /</span><h3>A shelf with a little breathing room</h3><p>Consider what stays within reach, what needs a label, and what could simply leave the room.</p></article><article class=\"story\"><span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02 /</span><h3>Materials that show their years</h3><p>A short prompt for looking at wear as a useful record rather than a flaw to disguise.</p></article><article class=\"story\"><span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03 /</span><h3>The case for a small routine</h3><p>Start with one repeatable action. Observe the friction before adding another tool or rule.</p></article></section><section id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\"><h2 id=\"about-title\">A quiet place to begin</h2><p>This original starter demonstrates editorial hierarchy. All article titles and descriptions are sample copy; replace them with your own writing before publishing.</p></section></main><footer>Static layout starter · no subscriptions, tracking, or external resources.</footer></div></body></html>"
}
